<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="Sx3.T2.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 2</span>: </span><span id="Sx3.T2.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Pairwise core geometry and CCA similarity.
