<span id="Sx5.T6.3.1.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_bb">GPT-2 Large <math id="Sx5.T6.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\times" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>×</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\times</annotation></semantics></math> GPT-2 Medium</span>
